	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nzdkkMH5bSMhZaC3d",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 4, DX 13, IQ 1, HT 10, HP 4, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 10, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nQA5AgU8fJ0pIOLxG",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense 1, protection -7), threat tier minor, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "ngejumrDoYNDCkS4V",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/giant-centipede.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "ndE7xjgYW4G-_xLeR",
			"text": "Independent build total: -113 points of racial traits plus 10 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHiWlpsr-I_96IbUT",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Centipede (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n8fBvPTqGH6q1O0Km",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nF6kG2HFZ9MsvGHz6",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 5 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nrzknBZSxZoWKb1j3",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "neGNSobX58vmvRd8I",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n0msJzoG8i1OQFYSc",
			"text": "About 90 cm, which is the SM -2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nsDBXsrt2M2Fq6wXc",
			"text": "IQ 1 — this is the floor, and correct. A centipede is a reflex arc with legs."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYHJDg75fzQUlPKHR",
			"text": "The venom is priced as a 15-point disabling ability so the rating can see it; the puncture alone would rate near zero."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFkcwld5t6rGhi027",
